# Markdown under `content/`

When **creating or editing** these files, follow the project skill **`markdown-formatting`** (`.cursor/skills/markdown-formatting/SKILL.md`).

**Tables (required):** every table must have a header row immediately followed by a separator row in this shape:

```markdown
| Coluna A | Coluna B | Coluna C |
| -- | ------ | -------- |
| valor | valor | valor |
```

Extend dash runs per column to align with header width when helpful. Canonical reference in-repo: `content/Data Engineering/Platform/Inventory/blend-risk-credit/plano-mitigacao.md` (section “### 2. BigQuery” — header `| ID | Ponto de falha | Manifestação típica |` plus `| -- | -------------- | ------------------- |`).

Before merge or Confluence publish, also apply **`markdown-confluence-publish`** validation.
